1302
01:27:14,371 --> 01:27:15,031
ama hareket

1303
01:27:15,031 --> 01:27:16,251
denkleminin

1304
01:27:16,251 --> 01:27:17,711
ama o zaman şunu

1305
01:27:17,711 --> 01:27:19,112
